{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_17d422b228a73f179d320671f97c534d01ef5c3e7a891b020b1cf265f1259100"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The container uses two volumes: /config for Cursor configuration files and /cursor for Cursor data files."},{"claim_ids":["clm_1df9617b3b8875a3183b2cc1246e4ff6104bcad1115cb76eae5c3f160ae244f3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Versioned Cursor builds with required files are stored in a cursor_versions folder, and root Dockerfiles target the latest Cursor version via an API call to Cursor's download endpoint."},{"claim_ids":["clm_31cbfe80f1a4f1b782a65b0c1db65bc8f3af3e4cc75ab5253449b5fc9e684335"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Prebuilt images are distributed via Docker Hub (arfodublo/cursor-in-browser) and GitHub Container Registry (ghcr.io/arfo-du-blo/cursor-in-browser); users may also clone and rebuild the image themselves."},{"claim_ids":["clm_469e42d86c416f7a1f82c0dcda63f18cdc1147d25341b6d50a1d9a4f947585ef"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The image packages Cursor; all x64 and arm64 Cursor versions from 0.47.7 onward are available, and the latest tag tracks the newest Cursor release."},{"claim_ids":["clm_47d9e5faa4311d3ae0fbd10983330c6047dd0d9e00a64cfc4ac5d1690d0c1ef9"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Closing Cursor leaves a black screen; users must right-click it and select the Cursor entry from the appearing menu to reopen the editor."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5dda39d62153b14f99b81cdffccf592cca235e447b9677275e54521f245699b0"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product is deployed as a Docker container exposing port 8080 internally, mapped in examples to host port 8050, and run detached via docker run."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7ac2c15ad361e20923a29a2c9b38a13c4816992894a5413899256e87870e6e7f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The project is strongly inspired by sytone/obsidian-remote, which packaged Obsidian for browser use in a similar way."},{"claim_ids":["clm_7ae78ebd74cc346bd53a0993c5bab5b79adfa60b65f4ae2cfea7fe730dc2fb22"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Due to browser sandbox restrictions, some buttons like Log in cannot be clicked directly; a popup shows external URLs so users can copy them into a new tab."},{"claim_ids":["clm_94f6824941f7f6f5ce7807da29954b9f1b384f1dd71fc4ad29309881fee16933"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Image tags encode Cursor version and CPU architecture, e.g. latest-x64, latest-arm64, or a pinned version like 1.2.3-x64."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b04b47561fb4f08f1ed08ff4f942e83244e22933a8c12dafd4db44914301e616"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Configurable environment variables include PUID and PGID (default 911), TZ (default Etc/UTC), and DOCKER_MODS for adding mods such as universal-git."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f53e747c6e86c5e0934c01844a3bf4fc6331363148c1361e15369f1aa344b584"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Access is configured through CUSTOM_USER and PASSWORD environment variables passed at container start."}],"claim_ids":["clm_17d422b228a73f179d320671f97c534d01ef5c3e7a891b020b1cf265f1259100","clm_1df9617b3b8875a3183b2cc1246e4ff6104bcad1115cb76eae5c3f160ae244f3","clm_31cbfe80f1a4f1b782a65b0c1db65bc8f3af3e4cc75ab5253449b5fc9e684335","clm_469e42d86c416f7a1f82c0dcda63f18cdc1147d25341b6d50a1d9a4f947585ef","clm_47d9e5faa4311d3ae0fbd10983330c6047dd0d9e00a64cfc4ac5d1690d0c1ef9","clm_5dda39d62153b14f99b81cdffccf592cca235e447b9677275e54521f245699b0","clm_7ac2c15ad361e20923a29a2c9b38a13c4816992894a5413899256e87870e6e7f","clm_7ae78ebd74cc346bd53a0993c5bab5b79adfa60b65f4ae2cfea7fe730dc2fb22","clm_94f6824941f7f6f5ce7807da29954b9f1b384f1dd71fc4ad29309881fee16933","clm_b04b47561fb4f08f1ed08ff4f942e83244e22933a8c12dafd4db44914301e616","clm_f53e747c6e86c5e0934c01844a3bf4fc6331363148c1361e15369f1aa344b584"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T03:35:01Z","created_by_operation":"op_6e416024304b4d0db0585a58614c16eb","id":"pg_4344b0f8ff2451dcb22e563f24d6a806","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/arfo-du-blo-cursor-in-browser-readme-md-a86ef5f7c0f4-563f24